{"script":"s_3_7_4_y","des":"将 1 个即抛型蛇鳞刺盾交给大市集的文员拉比尔【c3_area3_1】。","exps":[{"para":{"tag":"tag_1"},"key":"tag"},{"para":{"layer":"chara2"},"key":"top"},{"para":{"nameSide":"left","charaName":"文员拉比尔","text":"[show][color=f1401c]即抛型蛇鳞刺盾[colorEnd]……？了不起，果然是个好工具。我这就向上面提议批量生产，这样他们就能更好地对付魔爪蛇了。[l][cm]"},"key":"text"},{"para":{"tag":"tag_3"},"key":"tag"},{"para":{"nameSide":"left","charaName":"文员拉比尔","text":"[show]嗯……这样援助贫民街的计划就能步上正轨了。希望在大市集的帮助下，伊曼纽尔那边的日子也能越来越好吧……[l][cm]"},"key":"text"},{"para":{"tag":"tag_4"},"key":"tag"},{"para":{"alpha":0,"scaleX":1.5,"layer":"bg","img":"bgblack","mirrow":false,"x":-500,"trans":true,"y":-125,"noOut":false,"addImg":"","scaleY":1.5,"noIn":false,"bright":1},"key":"setLayer"},{"para":{"alpha":0.4,"scaleX":1.5,"layer":"bg","img":"bgblack","mirrow":false,"transTime":300,"x":-500,"trans":true,"y":-125,"noOut":false,"addImg":"","scaleY":1.5,"noIn":false,"bright":1},"key":"moveLayer"},{"para":{"time":300},"key":"wait"},{"para":{"alpha":0,"scaleX":1,"layer":"chara2","img":"chara002_2","mirrow":false,"x":340,"trans":true,"y":-180,"noOut":false,"addImg":"chara002_2_face_chara002_2e","scaleY":1,"noIn":false,"bright":1},"key":"setLayer"},{"para":{"alpha":1,"scaleX":1,"layer":"chara2","img":"chara002_2","mirrow":false,"transTime":300,"x":340,"trans":true,"y":-180,"noOut":false,"addImg":"chara002_2_face_chara002_2e","scaleY":1,"noIn":false,"bright":1},"key":"moveLayer"},{"para":{"time":300},"key":"wait"},{"para":{"nameSide":"left","charaName":"米托拉","text":"[show]只要大家肯努力，一定能摆脱险境的！不过你和伊曼纽尔之间到底发生了什么呀，有点好奇……[l][cm]"},"key":"text"},{"para":{"tag":"tag_5"},"key":"tag"},{"para":{"alpha":0,"scaleX":1,"layer":"chara2","img":"chara002_2","mirrow":false,"transTime":300,"x":340,"trans":true,"y":-180,"noOut":false,"addImg":"chara002_2_face_chara002_2e","scaleY":1,"noIn":false,"bright":1},"key":"moveLayer"},{"para":{"time":300},"key":"wait"},{"para":{"alpha":0,"scaleX":1.5,"layer":"bg","img":"bgblack","mirrow":false,"transTime":300,"x":-500,"trans":true,"y":-125,"noOut":false,"addImg":"","scaleY":1.5,"noIn":false,"bright":1},"key":"moveLayer"},{"para":{"time":300},"key":"wait"},{"para":{"nameSide":"left","charaName":"文员拉比尔","text":"[show]其实也没什么，很久以前，我和伊曼纽尔一直在四指镇共同生活。后来我们兄妹两人的能力都被水商商会看上了。我选择离开……而把贫民街视作新四指镇的她选择留了下来。[l][cm]"},"key":"text"},{"para":{"tag":"tag_6"},"key":"tag"},{"para":{"nameSide":"left","charaName":"文员拉比尔","text":"[show]我不介意帮助贫民街变得更好，但那里始终只是我人生的一个站点罢了。我想要更好的生活，所以我选择来大市集定居。[l][cm]"},"key":"text"},{"para":{"tag":"tag_7"},"key":"tag"},{"para":{"nameSide":"left","charaName":"文员拉比尔","text":"[show]但伊曼纽尔不仅想着要改变贫民街，还把自己完全奉献给了它。这种执着令我无法理解，不过这可能就是她的宝贵之处吧。[l][cm]"},"key":"text"},{"para":{"tag":"tag_8"},"key":"tag"},{"para":{"nameSide":"left","charaName":"文员拉比尔","text":"[show]选择的道路不同，就很难谈到一起去。只希望我们兄妹两能有真正重逢的那一天。这也算是我的一个……微不足道的愿望吧。[l][cm]"},"key":"text"},{"para":{"tag":"tag_9"},"key":"tag"},{"para":{"nameSide":"left","charaName":"文员拉比尔","text":"[show]好了，我的事就说到这里吧。还是很感谢两位契约者，因为你们的帮助，我们的计划开了一个好头。[l]"},"key":"text"},{"para":{"tag":"tag_10"},"key":"tag"},{"para":{"options":[{"text":"只是做了一些微不足道的事。","tag":"tag_11"}]},"key":"option"},{"para":{"tag":"tag_11"},"key":"tag"},{"para":{"nameSide":"left","charaName":"文员拉比尔","text":"[cm][show]不管怎么说，你们的贡献都非常大。这是你们的契约费，辛苦了。[l][cm]"},"key":"text"},{"para":{"tag":"tag_12"},"key":"tag"},{"para":{"alpha":0,"scaleX":1.5,"layer":"bg","img":"bgblack","mirrow":false,"x":-500,"trans":true,"y":-125,"noOut":false,"addImg":"","scaleY":1.5,"noIn":false,"bright":1},"key":"setLayer"},{"para":{"alpha":0.4,"scaleX":1.5,"layer":"bg","img":"bgblack","mirrow":false,"transTime":300,"x":-500,"trans":true,"y":-125,"noOut":false,"addImg":"","scaleY":1.5,"noIn":false,"bright":1},"key":"moveLayer"},{"para":{"time":300},"key":"wait"},{"para":{"alpha":0,"scaleX":1,"layer":"chara2","img":"chara002_2","mirrow":false,"x":340,"trans":true,"y":-180,"noOut":false,"addImg":"chara002_2_face_chara002_2a","scaleY":1,"noIn":false,"bright":1},"key":"setLayer"},{"para":{"alpha":1,"scaleX":1,"layer":"chara2","img":"chara002_2","mirrow":false,"transTime":300,"x":340,"trans":true,"y":-180,"noOut":false,"addImg":"chara002_2_face_chara002_2a","scaleY":1,"noIn":false,"bright":1},"key":"moveLayer"},{"para":{"time":300},"key":"wait"},{"para":{"nameSide":"left","charaName":"米托拉","text":"[show]好耶！非常感谢喵！[l][cm][hide]"},"key":"text"},{"para":{"tag":"tag_2"},"key":"tag"},{"para":{"alpha":0,"scaleX":1,"layer":"chara2","img":"chara002_2","mirrow":false,"transTime":300,"x":340,"trans":true,"y":-180,"noOut":false,"addImg":"chara002_2_face_chara002_2a","scaleY":1,"noIn":false,"bright":1},"key":"moveLayer"},{"para":{"time":300},"key":"wait"},{"para":{"alpha":0,"scaleX":1.5,"layer":"bg","img":"bgblack","mirrow":false,"transTime":300,"x":-500,"trans":true,"y":-125,"noOut":false,"addImg":"","scaleY":1.5,"noIn":false,"bright":1},"key":"moveLayer"},{"para":{"time":300},"key":"wait"},{"para":{"end":true},"key":"end"}]}